{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:04+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:58:04+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Iren SpA","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","country":"Italy","city":"Reggio Emilia","website":"https://www.gruppoiren.it","employees":11598,"summary":"Iren SpA, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a multi-utility company in Italy. The company produces and distributes electricity from hydroelectric, thermoelectric, cogeneration, and other renewables, as well as distributes natural gas. It distributes electrical energy through 7,939 kilometers of medium and low voltage networks to approximately 734,000 connected users; and natural gas through its network of approximately 9,578 kilometers of high, medium, and low-pressure pipes to approximately 934,000 customers. The company also operates integrated water cycle, which includes 24,000 kilometers of pipeline networks that serve 3 million residents; 13,000 kilometers of sewerage networks; and operates treatment plants. In addition, it is involved in the provision of services related to street lighting systems, traffic light systems, heating systems, and electrical and special systems; collection and disposal of waste; snow clearing services; and analysis laboratories, telecommunications, and other services. It operates 27 hydroelectric plants, 24 thermoelectric cogeneration systems, and 1 thermoelectric plant, as well as 113 photovoltaic production plants with an installed capacity of 228 MW. Iren SpA is based in Reggio Emilia, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Iren SpA, avec ses filiales, opère en tant que société multi-services en Italie. L’entreprise produit et distribue de l’électricité à partir d’énergies hydroélectriques, thermoélectriques, de cogénération et d’autres énergies renouvelables, ainsi que du gaz naturel. Il distribue de l'énergie électrique à travers 7 939 kilomètres de réseaux de moyenne et basse tension à environ 734 000 utilisateurs connectés; et du gaz naturel à travers son réseau d'environ 9 578 kilomètres de conduites haute, moyenne et basse pression à environ 934 000 clients."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3107609344,"shares_outstanding":1283075732,"trailing_pe":10.530435,"forward_pe":9.866786,"price_to_book":1.0539598,"ev_to_ebitda":6.593,"ev_to_revenue":1.248,"dividend_yield":0.056799997,"payout_ratio":0.6026,"beta_yahoo":0.796},"targets":{"current_price":2.422,"mean":3.03,"median":3.0,"high":3.3,"low":2.75,"n_analysts":5,"reco_mean":1.4,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-11"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-22","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.4995,"institutions_pct":0.12932,"institutions_float_pct":0.25838,"institutions_n":108,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0162,"shares":9007403,"value":21815929,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0108,"shares":6017658,"value":14574767,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0148},{"name":"Victory Portfolios-Victory Trivalent International Small-Cap Fund","pct":0.0107,"shares":5955990,"value":14425407,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0092,"shares":5137494,"value":12443010,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0052},{"name":"SPDR-EUROPE-SSgA SPDR ETFS Europe I-SPDR S&P Euro Dvdnd Arstcrts UCITS","pct":0.009,"shares":4993673,"value":12094675,"date":"2026-01-31","chg":0.0257},{"name":"SPDR INDEX SHARES Fd.S-State Street SPDR PORT. Developed World ex-US E","pct":0.0064,"shares":3588212,"value":8690649,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0063,"shares":34